## 六、事件契约

### cards ↔ rhythm_axis

| 事件 | 方向 | 载荷 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|------|
| `cards:request_rhythm_start` | cards → rhythm | `{card_instance_id, card_id, required_charge, rhythm_keys, rhythm_timeout, bpm}` | 请求启动节奏轴 |
| `cards:request_rhythm_stop` | cards → rhythm | `{context_id}` | 请求停止节奏轴 |
| `rhythm:context_started` | rhythm → cards | `{context_id, card_instance_id}` | **FIX-9 新增**：rhythm 启动后返回 context_id |
| `rhythm:input_judged` | rhythm → cards | `{context_id, block_id, result, delta}` | 判定结果 |

### cards 内部事件

| 事件 | 触发时机 | 关键载荷 |
|------|---------|---------|
| `cards:card_drawn` | 抽牌到手牌 | `instance_id`, `card_id`, `stage` |
| `cards:card_played` | 玩家出牌 | `instance_id`, `card_id` |
| `cards:charge_updated` | 充能增加 | `card`, `current`, `required`, `is_completed` |
| `cards:card_charged` | 充能完成 | `card` |
| `cards:charge_failed` | 充能失败 | `card` |
| `cards:card_discarded` | 卡牌进入弃牌堆 | `instance_id` |
| `cards:turn_started` | 回合开始 | `hand_size` |
| `cards:turn_ended` | 回合结束 | `discard_size` |
| `cards:effect_triggered` | 效果触发 | `card`, `effect_id`, `result` |
| `combo:detected` | 检测到连携 | `combo_id`, `bonus` |

